Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.67,0:22:55.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,It also can hold up to uh 32 um Instinct MI350P uh GPUs, um as well as a tremendous amount of networking capability.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.75,0:23:01.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, it's all coming together in a um open uh compute uh standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.36,0:23:08.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And when you look at how we expect these to be used, when you start in a hyperscale configuration,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.92,0:23:15.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,given the density of compute in hyperscale, you would imagine that you would have significant, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.96,0:23:24.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,GPU racks in one, you know, portion of the data center or one part of the deployment, but you can have your Agentic CPU racks,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.77,0:23:31.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know, really sitting side by side and you can mix and match the type of CPU nodes in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.45,0:23:36.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, whether you're looking at personal agents or enterprise agents or technical agents,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:41.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can pick the right compute for the right the right workload.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.01,0:23:49.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in the enterprise configuration, you can actually add another piece of this, which is, you know, a lot of enterprises are probably,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.92,0:23:56.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know, not running the most advanced foundational model, at least when they're running them on prem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.16,0:24:06.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,They could be actually wanting to have the ability to have both CPUs and GPUs in the same rack optimized for their particular workload.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.44,0:24:10.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, that is what we can do with the Helion rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.35,0:24:19.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I'm happy to say that there's been tremendously positive response to the to our Agentic rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.60,0:24:20.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, you know, two pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.90,0:24:30.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,One is we have a rich ecosystem that are offering the Helion rack starting November 26th and all of this is going to be contributed to OCP.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.78,0:24:40.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, you know, very excited for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.68,0:24:46.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay, so in the final few minutes, I thought I would just give you an update on our silicon.
