Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.59,0:25:12.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh we talked about the various flavors of Venice including our workhorse um for gigantic CPU servers,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.39,0:25:21.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Venice 256 core, our general purpose CPU servers as well as our CPUs for host nodes, the Venice um high frequency.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.58,0:25:32.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,And all of that is great, but I have uh when I saw you in July, I showed you four pieces of silicon and uh we have some new silicon to show you today.
