Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.24,0:26:26.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh there's a lot of excitement about Verano as well as the rest of the Venice family and uh we will be in production in uh the first half of 2027.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.80,0:26:31.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um so, with that, um let me conclude and say, "Look, we love OCP.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.36,0:26:33.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,We love the open ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.73,0:26:38.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um open is a foundation for what we care about at AMD.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.11,0:26:40.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um it is uh open on every level.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.09,0:26:42.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's open on the hardware level.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.16,0:26:43.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh it's open with specs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.96,0:26:45.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's working with our partners.
