Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.92,0:27:00.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, I'm very happy to say a lot of our partners are here at OCP this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.77,0:27:08.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um I think it's fantastic all of the work that's coming together and all of the learnings that we will get from bringing um the teams together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.07,0:27:15.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, again, I want to say a big thank you to OCP for really bringing together this what I would call collaboration at scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.84,0:27:21.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's an opportunity for each of us to innovate on the things that we're best at and also for each of us
